+# FEAT-P2-002: the offsite job retries with exponential backoff and writes a persistent
+# dead-letter marker only when every attempt is exhausted; fire as soon as the marker
+# exists rather than waiting for the 36 h freshness window to lapse.
+write_rule "falcon-backup-offsite-dlq" \
+  "Offsite backup retries exhausted (dead-letter)" 'falcon_backup_offsite_dlq > 0' "1m" "critical" \
+  "The offsite backup exhausted its retry/backoff attempts and left a dead-letter marker; the Spaces/R2 copy is missing until a later run succeeds."
+
